Mercury
=======

Mercury is a modified fork of Min (https://github.com/minbrowser/min).

  Upstream project:  Min, https://github.com/minbrowser/min
  Upstream version:  v1.35.7
  Forked on:         2026-10-18
  Upstream licence:  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE.txt, retained unchanged)
  This project:      Mercury, https://github.com/Divine-Owl/Mercury-Browser

Modifications
-------------

The fork renames the product and removes its network-facing infrastructure. The
changes below are all of them; the rest of the code is Min v1.35.7.

Identity:

  - The product is named Mercury. The binary and package are `mercury-browser`,
    the desktop entry is `org.mercury.Browser`, and the version starts at 0.1.0.
  - The internal URL scheme was renamed from `min://` to `mercury://`, including
    the preload scripts that guard on it.
  - Window titles, HTML titles, user-agent strings, the search-engine tag, the
    registry entries and the packaging metadata were rebranded.
  - The user-facing strings in all 35 localisation files were rebranded. The key
    set of each file is unchanged.

Removals (features that communicated with Min's infrastructure):

  - Usage statistics collection, its setting, and its settings-page toggle.
  - The update feed and the update notification UI.
  - The first-run tour, and a survey prompt that was already dead code.
  - Page translation, which was the last live request path to a Min-run service.
  - Min's donation, download, community and Discord links.

Telemetry-free: Mercury collects no usage statistics and has no update feed. It
does not contact minbrowser.org or any host operated by the Min project.

